==Latin==
[[File:Anser anser 2 (Piotr Kuczynski).jpg|thumb|anser (a goose)]]

===Etymology===
From presumed {{der|la|itc-pro|*hāns}} (stem {{m|itc-pro||*han-s-}}, where the strong stem was most likely contaminated by the weak stem, resulting in {{m|itc-pro||*hānsez-}} > {{m+|la||(h)ānser-}}), from {{der|la|ine-pro|*ǵʰh₂éns}} (or similar; the reconstruction is debated). The form is possibly influenced by unrelated {{m|la|anas||duck}}. Cognates include {{cog|sa|हंस}}, {{cog|grc|χήν}}, {{cog|ru|гусь}}, {{cog|sga|géiss}}, {{cog|ang|gōs}} ({{cog|en|goose}}), and {{cog|sq|gatë||heron}}.

